{"name": "Zombies Per Minute", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE FACTORY MUST KILL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"660\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/b339bbd5f9c7acf524ba391b55a17c62.poster.avif?t=1795045898\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/b339bbd5f9c7acf524ba391b55a17c62.webm?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/b339bbd5f9c7acf524ba391b55a17c62.mp4?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zombies Per Minute is a  roguelite factory tower defense game where everything you build is measured by one thing: how many zombies you can kill per minute.\u00a0Yes, really.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"660\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/c27842f8e9612564646a02c2df09a2af.poster.avif?t=1795045898\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/c27842f8e9612564646a02c2df09a2af.webm?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/c27842f8e9612564646a02c2df09a2af.mp4?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> All runs are different, depending on the maps, buildings, upgrades and relics you unlock when you succeed building high-ZPM outposts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission: build, survive, automate, and push your ZPM  as high as it'll go. And it can go... VERY high.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">  -\u00a0<strong>BUILD -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"660\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/6419f22166fff6c6101606273e24eb88.poster.avif?t=1795045898\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/6419f22166fff6c6101606273e24eb88.webm?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/6419f22166fff6c6101606273e24eb88.mp4?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every game starts from scratch. Scout the area to decide what to build, where you'll setup your defenses and what kind of resources you have access to.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- AUTOMATE -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"660\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/9f0b11f28c1f2cd4c27224883df64e85.poster.avif?t=1795045898\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/9f0b11f28c1f2cd4c27224883df64e85.webm?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/9f0b11f28c1f2cd4c27224883df64e85.mp4?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An operator is fast, but cannot do everything manually. You'll need to automate and scale your small outpost into a huge, massive zombie shredder. The factory must grow. And it must grow fast.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- SET UP DEFENSES -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"660\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/22a3b3b58893d8ab08ecb17ad8222877.poster.avif?t=1795045898\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/22a3b3b58893d8ab08ecb17ad8222877.webm?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/22a3b3b58893d8ab08ecb17ad8222877.mp4?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set and arm your perimeter depending on the map geography and also we heard some zombies have mutated, whatever that means. You might need bigger guns. Oh and keep the ammunition flowing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- RESEARCH -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"660\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/1a282d864431fc0f84fd33a2fdb0017a.poster.avif?t=1795045898\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/1a282d864431fc0f84fd33a2fdb0017a.webm?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/1a282d864431fc0f84fd33a2fdb0017a.mp4?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock a huge amount of new recipes, new weapons, new defenses and new buildings that match your strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- UPGRADE -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"660\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/98d29568eac11c9792efedf5f403fb38.poster.avif?t=1795045898\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/98d29568eac11c9792efedf5f403fb38.webm?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/98d29568eac11c9792efedf5f403fb38.mp4?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Analyze Zombies' DNA to receive CPU Upgrades. Pick wisely, as you can only choose 6 upgrades. Every game is different.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- REPEAT -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"660\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/e922f4702acdda0d1948c21f27d44ac5.poster.avif?t=1795045898\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/e922f4702acdda0d1948c21f27d44ac5.webm?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/e922f4702acdda0d1948c21f27d44ac5.mp4?t=1795045898\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every outpost helps us learn more about what happened. New buildings, new areas, new upgrades and even new operators can be unlocked or improved; helping us venture deeper and deeper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- OTHER ELEMENTS -</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural:</strong> each run has a seed and is entirely procedural.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelite:</strong> each run is different, depending on the CPU Upgrades you choose from,  the operator (science, economy, combat) you select or the  science path you pick to follow. What will be the best combination to go in the million of ZPM?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progression:</strong> unlock more buildings, zombie types, defenses, upgrades and map types between each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Campaign:</strong> explore an Earth that has become entirely zombified and discover what happened, in 12 epic missions.\u00a0In this mode, you are the Operator, a machine guided by CLAIRE, an orbital AI searching for survivors in a world overrun by the living dead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaderboard:</strong>\u00a0in Endless mode, be among the best. Only one indicator matters: the <strong>Zombies Per Minute</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"432\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/extras/510b96299a6617bf685ef63bad5484bb.avif?t=1795045898\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">--</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  The game is in active development, and made with love by a single person!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance, Upgrades, Buildings, etc. are all currently being designed and tested and may change over time.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Zombies Per Minute is a factory-building roguelite where everything you build is measured by one thing: how many zombies you can kill per minute. Yes, really. Use your imagination to grow your factory, make decisive choices each wave and progress from one outpost to the other. Until Earth is saved.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416970/c416b1f908a567a71324636196173d1e73923892/header.jpg?t=1795045898", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "Strategy", "Automation", "Tower Defense", "Roguelite", "Base Building"], "developers": "Enzed Studio", "publishers": "Enzed Studio", "release_date": "2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4416970", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "19 November 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/vFTYFtQEPCU", "first_seen": 1795042800.0, "review_rank": 3}